# Design System

Full reference: `docs/design/design-system.md`
Component library & tokens: `packages/ui/` (`.cursor/rules/ui-spec.mdc`)

## Typography

- **Sans:** Geist Sans via `next/font` → `--font-sans`
- **Mono:** Geist Mono → `--font-mono` (IDs, tokens, QR debug)
- Page title: `text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight`
- Body (ERP density): `text-sm` (14px)
- Table meta: `text-xs text-muted-foreground`

## Colors

Use shadcn CSS variables in `globals.css`. Single accent: **blue** (`--primary`).

| Semantic | Usage |
|----------|-------|
| `primary` | CTAs, active nav |
| `muted` | Secondary surfaces |
| `destructive` | Delete, reject |
| `emerald-600` | Success states |
| `amber-600` | Warning states |

Support light and dark mode from day one. Set theme once in root layout.

## Layout

- **Shell:** collapsible sidebar + top bar (shadcn Sidebar)
- **Density:** compact — `py-4` sections, sticky table headers
- **Icons:** `@tabler/icons-react`, stroke 1.5, one family per project
- **Radius:** 8px inputs, 12px cards, full pill buttons (documented rule)

## Components

Import shadcn from `packages/ui` or app-local `components/ui/`, **aligned with shadcn/ui patterns in** `packages/ui/src/components/ui/`. Never ship default uncustomized theme or patterns absent from packages/ui.

Required patterns: DataTable, Form, Dialog, Sheet, Badge, Tabs, Skeleton loaders.

## Accessibility

- WCAG 2.1 AA contrast on forms and tables
- 44px min touch targets on mobile bind flow
- `prefers-reduced-motion`: disable sidebar transitions
- Visible focus rings on all interactive elements

## Portals

| App | Shell component |
|-----|-----------------|
| `apps/admin` | `AdminShell` — tenant switcher in top bar |
| `apps/merchant` | `MerchantShell` — standard sidebar |
| `apps/store` | `StoreShell` (Phase 2) — consumer layout |
